How many times does `count++` run?
```c
count = 0;
for (i = 0; i < 6; i++)
    for (j = 0; j < i; j++)
        count++;
```

How many times does `x++` run for n = 5?
```c
for (i = 1; i <= n; i++)
    for (j = i; j <= n; j++)
        for (k = j; k <= n; k++)
            x++;
```

How many times does `c++` run for n = 50, and what is the order of growth?
```c
for (i = 1; i * i <= n; i++)
    for (j = 1; j <= n; j++)
        c++;
```

