examples.setup:
Read off the recurrence and find the total work for n = 8.
```c
void w(int n) {
    if (n <= 1) return;       // costs 1
    for (i = 0; i < n; i++)   // n units of work
        work();
    w(n / 2);
    w(n / 2);
}
```

Find the total work for n = 8.
```c
void v(int n) {
    if (n <= 0) return;
    for (i = 1; i <= n; i = i * 2)   // how many runs?
        work();
    v(n - 1);
}
```

